            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\n'mini.comment' works on the Neovim 0.12 without issues. The stack trace shows that the error comes from `ts_context_commentstring` module when 'mini.comment' tries to compute custom commentstring (that is probably provided in your setup).",
