        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "@echasnovski thank you for your reply! I am not sure what you mean with the custom commentstring, I've never set up anything like that. I'm also using LazyVim and mini.comment as part of LazyExtras, so maybe it's something about Lazy's config. The only thing I have configured additionally is:\n\n```\nreturn {\n  {\n    \"nvim-mini/mini.comment\",\n    opts = {\n      options = {\n        start_of_line = true,\n        --         ignore_blank_line = true,\n        --         pad_comment_parts = false,\n      },\n    },\n  },\n}\n\n```\n\nThis used to work without any problem in 0.11 though, problems only started since I upgraded to 0.12. I must also add that I am really new to neovim, lazyvim and the whole eco system so I'm not super knowledgeable when it comes to troubleshooting these kinds of issues but I try my best. \n\nMaybe you have any other ideas what could cause the issue here? \n\nThanks in advance and all the best\n\nJanis",
