            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "You are absolutely right, the issues comes from https://github.com/JoosepAlviste/nvim-ts-context-commentstring\nI removed the mini.comment extra from LazyVim and reinstalled it and noticed after relaunching nvim that nvim-ts-context-commentstring is also being installed and is also the cause of that issue. Thanks for helping to troubleshoot the issue :)|\nI am sure it'll not take long before the PRs are merged. 0.12 just came out a couple hours ago :)\nHave a nice evening!",
